        <mxCell id="c163" value="&lt;i&gt;DAX query view of the model editor after Run, with the query of Exercise C.1, Step 3: one row for each fiscal quarter of the three years, ordered by year and period. Outlined: the four rows of fiscal 2026, which are the Expected results. The four quarters&#x27; lines, revenue and list amount add to the year&#x27;s; their discounts, each rounded to the cent, add to $362,110.74, a cent below the year&#x27;s $362,110.75. The grid shows the values as the query returns them, without the measures&#x27; format, and cuts a long header with an ellipsis. Key Measures heads the Data pane because its only column, Column1, is hidden; its measures are listed alphabetically.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="835" width="860" height="83" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
